pan><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [fallback],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(retryDate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                completion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(timeline)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三方法对比\">三方法对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">方法</th>\n<th align=\"left\">调用时机</th>\n<th align=\"left\">可执行网络</th>\n<th align=\"left\">超时要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>placeholder</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">添加 widget 到主屏时</td>\n<td align=\"left\">否，必须立即返回</td>\n<td align=\"left\">极短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>getSnapshot</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Widget 库预览、Smart Stack</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不推荐，应使用缓存</td>\n<td align=\"left\">短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>getTimeline</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">系统调度的实际刷新</td>\n<td align=\"left\">是</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较宽松</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ios-刷新策略-timelinereloadpolicy\">iOS 刷新策略（TimelineReloadPolicy）</h2><p><code>getTimeline</code> 返回的 <code>Timeline</code> 对象包含一个刷新策略，告诉系统何时重新请求数据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">行为</th>\n<th align=\"left\">适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>.atEnd</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">最后一条 entry 的日期过后刷新</td>\n<td align=\"left\">日历事件、天气预报等可预测数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>.after(Date)</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">在指定日期后刷新</td>\n<td align=\"left\">特定时间点的数据（如比赛开始前）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>.never</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">永不自动刷新，仅由应用主动触发</td>\n<td align=\"left\">完全由用户操作驱动的 widget</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"主动触发刷新\">主动触发刷新</h3><p>主应用可以通过 <code>WidgetCenter</code> 主动通知 widget 刷新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import WidgetKit&#10;&#10;// 刷新指定 kind 的所有 widget 实例&#10;WidgetCenter.shared.reloadTimelines(ofKind: &quot;WeatherWidget&quot;)&#10;&#10;// 刷新所有 widget&#10;WidgetCenter.shared.reloadAllTimelines()&#10;&#10;// 针对配置型 widget，刷新使用特定 intent 的实例&#10;WidgetCenter.shared.reloadTimelines(&#10;    ofKind: &quot;AccountWidget&quot;,&#10;    filter: { intent in&#10;        (intent as? SelectAccountIntent)?.accountType == .savings&#10;    }&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WidgetKit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 刷新指定 kind 的所有 widget 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">WidgetCenter.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reloadTimelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ofKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WeatherWidget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 刷新所有 widget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">WidgetCenter.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reloadAllTimelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 针对配置型 widget，刷新使用特定 intent 的实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">WidgetCenter.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reloadTimelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ofKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AccountWidget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { intent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (intent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SelectAccountIntent)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.accountType </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .savings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong> 系统会对刷新频率进行节流。即使调用 <code>reloadTimelines</code>，实际的 <code>getTimeline</code> 调用也可能被延迟。苹果建议每小时不超过数次主动刷新。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"android-生命周期回调\">Android 生命周期回调</h2><p><code>AppWidgetProvider</code> 提供四个核心回调方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyWidgetProvider : AppWidgetProvider() {&#10;&#10;    // 每次更新时调用（按 updatePeriodMillis 或用户添加时）&#10;    override fun onUpdate(&#10;        context: Context,&#10;        appWidgetManager: AppWidgetManager,&#10;        appWidgetIds: IntArray&#10;    ) {&#10;        for (id in appWidgetIds) {&#10;            updateSingleWidget(context, appWidgetManager, id)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 第一个 widget 实例被创建时调用（全局一次性初始化）&#10;    override fun onEnabled(context: Context) {&#10;        // 启动定期更新任务、注册监听等&#10;        val workRequest = PeriodicWorkRequestBuilder&lt;WidgetUpdateWorker&gt;(&#10;            15, TimeUnit.MINUTES  // WorkManager 最小周期为 15 分钟&#10;        ).build()&#10;        WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueueUniquePeriodicWork(&#10;            &quot;widget_update&quot;,&#10;            ExistingPeriodicWorkPolicy.KEEP,&#10;            workRequest&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 最后一个 widget 实例被移除时调用&#10;    override fun onDisabled(context: Context) {&#10;        // 取消定期任务、注销监听&#10;        WorkManager.getInstance(context).cancelUniqueWork(&quot;widget_update&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 特定 widget 实例被移除时调用&#10;    override fun onDeleted(context: Context, appWidgetIds: IntArray) {&#10;        // 清理该实例相关的数据&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyWidgetProvider : AppWidgetProvider() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 每次更新时调用（按 updatePeriodMillis 或用户添加时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onUpdate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        appWidgetManager: AppWidgetManager,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        appWidgetIds: IntArray</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (id in appWidgetIds) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            updateSingleWidget(context, appWidgetManager, id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 第一个 widget 实例被创建时调用（全局一次性初始化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onEnabled(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 启动定期更新任务、注册监听等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val workRequest = PeriodicWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;WidgetUpdateWorker>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            15, TimeUnit.MINUTES  // WorkManager 最小周期为 15 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueueUniquePeriodicWork(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"widget_update\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ExistingPeriodicWorkPolicy.KEEP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            workRequest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 最后一个 widget 实例被移除时调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onDisabled(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 取消定期任务、注销监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WorkManager.getInstance(context).cancelUniqueWork(\"widget_update\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 特定 widget 实例被移除时调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onDeleted(context: Context, appWidgetIds: IntArray) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 清理该实例相关的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"android-刷新机制\">Android 刷新机制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">刷新方式</th>\n<th align=\"left\">最小间隔</th>\n<th align=\"left\">精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>updatePeriodMillis</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">30 分钟</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不精确，系统节流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>WorkManager</code> 周期任务</td>\n<td align=\"left\">15 分钟</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较精确，受 Doze 模式影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>AlarmManager</code> + 广播</td>\n<td align=\"left\">自定义（精确闹钟受限）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">精确闹钟需要特殊权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">推送通知触发</td>\n<td align=\"left\">实时</td>\n<td align=\"left\">实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">应用内主动调用 <code>updateAppWidget</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">实时</td>\n<td align=\"left\">实时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"使用-workmanager-实现灵活更新\">使用 WorkManager 实现灵活更新</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class WidgetUpdateWorker(&#10;    context: Context,&#10;    params: WorkerParameters&#10;) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {&#10;        return try {&#10;            val data = fetchWidgetData()&#10;            val manager = AppWidgetManager.getInstance(applicationContext)&#10;            val component = ComponentName(applicationContext, MyWidgetProvider::class.java)&#10;            val ids = manager.getAppWidgetIds(component)&#10;&#10;            for (id in ids) {&#10;                updateAppWidget(applicationContext, manager, id, data)&#10;            }&#10;            Result.success()&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            Result.retry()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class WidgetUpdateWorker(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    params: WorkerParameters</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val data = fetchWidgetData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val manager = AppWidgetManager.getInstance(applicationContext)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val component = ComponentName(applicationContext, MyWidgetProvider::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val ids = manager.getAppWidgetIds(component)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for (id in ids) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                updateAppWidget(applicationContext, manager, id, data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Result.success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Result.retry()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"系统节流与电池优化\">系统节流与电池优化</h2><p>两个平台都对 widget 的后台活动进行严格限制：</p>\n<h3 id=\"ios-限制\">iOS 限制</h3><ul>\n<li>系统根据 widget 的使用频率（用户是否经常查看）动态分配刷新预算</li>\n<li>低电量模式下，非关键刷新可能被延迟或跳过</li>\n<li>Widget 进程内存超限会被系统终止</li>\n<li>后台 <code>AppIntent</code> 执行时间有限制</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"android-限制\">Android 限制</h3><ul>\n<li>Doze 模式下，<code>updatePeriodMillis</code> 和 <code>WorkManager</code> 任务被延迟到维护窗口执行</li>\n<li>App Standby Buckets 将应用分为不同优先级桶，低频应用的 widget 更新频率更低</li>\n<li>后台执行限制（Android 8.0+）禁止隐式广播，<code>AppWidgetProvider</code> 的更新回调不受此限制但仍受电池优化影响</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"省电策略建议\">省电策略建议</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">iOS</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Android</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">批量预计算</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>getTimeline</code> 返回多条 entry</td>\n<td align=\"left\">一次 <code>onUpdate</code> 更新所有实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">缓存优先</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>getSnapshot</code> 使用缓存数据</td>\n<td align=\"left\">本地数据库缓存最新数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">网络合并</td>\n<td align=\"left\">与主应用共享网络请求结果</td>\n<td align=\"left\">使用 WorkManager 的合并网络约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">降级处理</td>\n<td align=\"left\">失败时返回 fallback entry</td>\n<td align=\"left\">网络不可用时显示缓存数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台刷新策略设计\">跨平台刷新策略设计</h2><p>对于同时支持 iOS 和 Android 的应用，建议采用统一的刷新策略设计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;数据层&quot;&#10;        API[&quot;远程 API&quot;]&#10;        CACHE[&quot;本地缓存&lt;br/&gt;App Group / Room&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;触发层&quot;&#10;        PUSH[&quot;推送通知&lt;br/&gt;APNs / FCM&quot;]&#10;        SCHED[&quot;定时调度&lt;br/&gt;Timeline / WorkManager&quot;]&#10;        USER[&quot;用户操作&lt;br/&gt;AppIntent / action&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;渲染层&quot;&#10;        IOSW[&quot;iOS Widget&lt;br/&gt;SwiftUI View&quot;]&#10;        ANDW[&quot;Android Widget&lt;br/&gt;Glance / RemoteViews&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    API --&gt; CACHE&#10;    CACHE --&gt; IOSW&#10;    CACHE --&gt; ANDW&#10;    PUSH --&gt;|&quot;触发刷新&quot;| IOSW&#10;    PUSH --&gt;|&quot;触发刷新&quot;| ANDW&#10;    SCHED --&gt; IOSW&#10;    SCHED --&gt; ANDW&#10;    USER --&gt;|&quot;更新数据&quot;| CACHE&#10;    USER --&gt;|&quot;触发重绘&quot;| IOSW&#10;    USER --&gt;|&quot;触发重绘&quot;| ANDW\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"数据层\"\n        API[\"远程 API\"]\n        CACHE[\"本地缓存&lt;br/&gt;App Group / Room\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"触发层\"\n        PUSH[\"推送通知&lt;br/&gt;APNs / FCM\"]\n        SCHED[\"定时调度&lt;br/&gt;Timeline / WorkManager\"]\n        USER[\"用户操作&lt;br/&gt;AppIntent / action\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"渲染层\"\n        IOSW[\"iOS Widget&lt;br/&gt;SwiftUI View\"]\n        ANDW[\"Android Widget&lt;br/&gt;Glance / RemoteViews\"]\n    end\n\n    API --&gt; CACHE\n    CACHE --&gt; IOSW\n    CACHE --&gt; ANDW\n    PUSH --&gt;|\"触发刷新\"| IOSW\n    PUSH --&gt;|\"触发刷新\"| ANDW\n    SCHED --&gt; IOSW\n    SCHED --&gt; ANDW\n    USER --&gt;|\"更新数据\"| CACHE\n    USER --&gt;|\"触发重绘\"| IOSW\n    USER --&gt;|\"触发重绘\"| ANDW</pre><p>核心原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据与渲染分离</strong> — widget 只读取缓存，不直接发起网络请求（除非在 <code>getTimeline</code> 中）</li>\n<li><strong>推送驱动实时更新</strong> — 需要实时性的场景（体育比分、外卖状态），用推送触发刷新</li>\n<li><strong>批量预计算</strong> — 尽可能在一次刷新中提供多条未来数据</li>\n<li><strong>优雅降级</strong> — 网络失败时显示缓存数据，避免空白 widget</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>iOS <code>TimelineProvider</code> 三方法各司其职：<code>placeholder</code> 占位、<code>getSnapshot</code> 快速预览、<code>getTimeline</code> 实际更新</li>\n<li><code>TimelineReloadPolicy</code> 三种策略：<code>.atEnd</code>、<code>.after(date)</code>、<code>.never</code></li>\n<li>Android <code>AppWidgetProvider</code> 四回调：<code>onUpdate</code>、<code>onEnabled</code>、<code>onDisabled</code>、<code>onDeleted</code></li>\n<li><code>updatePeriodMillis</code> 最小 30 分钟，更灵活的调度使用 <code>WorkManager</code>（最小 15 分钟）</li>\n<li>两个平台都对后台活动进行电池优化节流，刷新时间不保证精确</li>\n<li>最佳实践：缓存优先、批量预计算、推送驱动实时更新、优雅降级</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关内容请参阅 <a href=\"widgetkit-ios\">iOS WidgetKit 开发</a> 和 <a href=\"widget-engineering/widget-data-provider\">数据提供与 Timeline</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"小组件生命周期与刷新机制","id":"小组件生命周期与刷新机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS TimelineProvider 三方法","id":"ios-timelineprovider-三方法"},{"level":3,"text":"三方法对比","id":"三方法对比"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 刷新策略（TimelineReloadPolicy）","id":"ios-刷新策略-timelinereloadpolicy"},{"level":3,"text":"主动触发刷新","id":"主动触发刷新"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 生命周期回调","id":"android-生命周期回调"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 刷新机制","id":"android-刷新机制"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 WorkManager 实现灵活更新","id":"使用-workmanager-实现灵活更新"},{"level":2,"text":"系统节流与电池优化","id":"系统节流与电池优化"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 限制","id":"ios-限制"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 限制","id":"android-限制"},{"level":3,"text":"省电策略建议","id":"省电策略建议"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台刷新策略设计","id":"跨平台刷新策略设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Android AppWidget 与 Jetpack Glance","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/widget-foundations/appwidget-android"},"next":{"title":"ActivityKit 与实时活动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-widget-live-activities/live-activities/activitykit-live-activities"}}